[ti:竹取飛翔]
[al:Touhou Boston 2012]
[ar:ボストン東方樂団]
[cv:https://upload.thbwiki.cc/thumb/d/dc/Touhou_Boston_2012%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg/400px-Touhou_Boston_2012%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg]
